      "locator": "310-322",
      "doi": "10.1111/j.1365-246X.2012.05511.x"
    },
    "structure_location": "Methods and Table 1: three 80-atom supercell shapes derived from the 20-atom Pbnm cell; no complete coordinates or zero-pressure lattice are tabulated.",
